  "goodToKnow": "Der Steuerzahler (die Steuerzahlerin) is a taxpayer: auf Kosten der Steuerzahler (at the taxpayers' expense). Every year, the Bund der Steuerzahler (Taxpayers' Association) publishes its Schwarzbuch listing wasted public money, such as bridges to nowhere. Note: die Steuer is tax, but das Steuer is a steering wheel. Germans file a Steuererklärung (tax return), often with the help of a Steuerberater."
